Description-en: Oracle Linux kernel extra modules for version 5.13.0 on 64 bit x86 SMP
 This package contains the Oracle Linux kernel extra modules for version 5.13.0 on
 64 bit x86 SMP.
 .
 Also includes the corresponding System.map file, the modules built by the
 packager, and scripts that try to ensure that the system is not left in an
 unbootable state after an update.
 .
 Supports Oracle processors.
 .
 Geared toward Oracle Cloud systems.
 .
 You likely do not want to install this package directly. Instead, install
 the linux-oracle meta-package, which will ensure that upgrades work
 correctly, and that supporting packages are also installed.

